<title>USA: CANTV Finance sets $200 mln in 2-part debt deal.</title>
<headline>CANTV Finance sets $200 mln in 2-part debt deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt issue from CANTV Finance Ltd was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CANTV FINANCE LTD</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 8.875 PCT  MATURITY 2/01/2002</p>
<p>TYPE GTD NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.75   FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2   YIELD 8.939 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 260 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 9.25 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE GTD NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.81   FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2   YIELD 9.288 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 285 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTE: CANTV FINANCE LTD IS A UNIT OF COMPANIA ANSNIMA NACIONAL TELEFONOS DE VENEZUELA U.S. corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
